Selenium Automation Practice
This project contains my hands-on practice with Selenium WebDriver using Java.

Topics Practised
- Browser launch and navigation
- Web elements and locators
- Text boxes, buttons, checkboxes and radio buttons
- Dropdown handling
- Alerts and frames
- Window handling
- File upload
- Drag and drop
- Tables and tooltips

Technologies Used
- Java
- Selenium WebDriver
- Maven
- Eclipse IDE

Project Structure
  src/test/java/com/automateWebsite` – Selenium practice scripts.
Purpose

This project demonstrates my learning and practical implementation of Selenium WebDriver concepts.
